                                      Step 9, on NEXT: stop: record the review this run stopped on (its commit and tree, from the newest
                                      via:ship review row bound to one committed tree) as a stop record in the runs block, and print the
                                      round-grant command that buys its fix round (STOP_RECORD:, NEXT:); the stopping row is the newest
                                      full pass, fix-check or Step 11 voice, so the stop is the head it read (#4591); it also marks this
